Where is Faisal Town Block B? | Faisal Town Block B is part of Faisal Town Phase 1/F-18 Islamabad and sits beside Block A within the Phase 1 development.

Is Block B part of Faisal Town Phase 2? | No. Block B on this page refers to Faisal Town Phase 1/F-18. Phase 2 uses separate sector and enclave terminology.

What plot sizes are available in Faisal Town Block B? | Common residential sizes include approximately 8 marla, 10 marla, 14 marla and 1 kanal. Current resale inventory strongly includes 8 and 10 marla plots.

What is the size of an 8-marla plot in Block B? | Current listings commonly describe 8-marla Block B plots as approximately 30 x 60.

What is the size of a 10-marla plot in Block B? | Current listings commonly describe 10-marla plots as approximately 35 x 70.

What is the current price of an 8-marla plot in Block B? | Recent asking prices vary significantly by location, with current examples roughly ranging from the PKR 1.3-crore level to above PKR 1.8 crore. Always compare current like-for-like listings before deciding. :contentReference[oaicite:7]{index=7}

What is the current price of a 10-marla plot in Block B? | Current asking prices are commonly around the PKR 2-crore range, although exact street, corner status and other location factors can materially change the price. :contentReference[oaicite:8]{index=8}

Are Block B plots available for sale? | Yes. Current property portals show active residential and commercial plot inventory in Faisal Town Phase 1 Block B. :contentReference[oaicite:9]{index=9}

Is Block B good for investment? | It may suit some investors because it is an established Phase 1 resale market, but the exact entry price, road position, dues and resale demand should be assessed for each plot.

Should I compare Block B with Block A and Block C? | Yes. Compare the same plot size, exact location, access, total payable amount and surrounding development before choosing.
